Assertions:
[DOM] on the checkout page of a punchout session the button is labelled 'Create requisition' and 'Place order' is absent {SPEC}
[COUNT] the cXML holds exactly 3 ItemIn elements {SPEC}
[REL] the set of SupplierPartID values in the cXML == the SKUs P1, P2, P3 shown in CHK_LINES {SPEC}
[REL] each ItemIn quantity == the quantity added for the same SKU {SPEC}
[MATH] each UnitPrice/Money == the after-promotion unit price shown for that line in CHK_LINES, printed with exactly 2 decimals {SPEC}
[REL] Total/Money == CHK_SUBTOTAL (shipping and tax are outside the message by design) {SPEC}
[REL] the BuyerCookie in the cXML == COOKIE {SPEC}
[STATE] the browser location is the return page after the click {SPEC}

[REL] the set of SupplierPartID values in the cXML == SCREEN_SKUS (the cart the buyer reviewed is the cart sent) {SPEC}
[DER] SCREEN_SKUS contains PY, the named cart's product, when the storefront shows the named cart {OBSERVED}
[COUNT] the cXML holds exactly as many ItemIn elements as the checkout page shows lines {SPEC}

[REL] when a message was sent, SENT_SKUS == SHOWN_SKUS, the cart the buyer reviewed is the cart sent {SPEC}
[DOM] the SKU of PA, the line with the invalid quantity, is absent from the sent cXML {SPEC}
[REL] BUTTON_ENABLED == true only if the cart that is actually sent has no line with a validation error {SPEC}
[STATE] SHOWN_ERRORS is empty, so the displayed named cart is valid and the button is enabled for it {OBSERVED}
[STATE] no 'PRODUCT_QTY_INSUFFICIENT' error is the reason for a refusal of the cart that holds PB {SPEC}

[REL] Header From Identity in the cXML == the To Identity of the setup request (supplier) and Header To Identity == the From Identity of the setup request (buyer-co) {SPEC}
[REL] the Sender credential in the cXML == the From credential of the message {SPEC}
[DOM] the posted cXML contains no 'SharedSecret' element anywhere {SPEC}
[DOM] the value of {{secret0}} and the last path segment of START_URL are absent from the posted cXML {OBSERVED}
[REL] BuyerCookie in the cXML == COOKIE {SPEC}
[DOM] UserAgent is 'Virto Commerce Punchout' and PunchOutOrderMessage operationAllowed is 'create' {SPEC}
[REL] SupplierPartID == the SKU of P1 and SupplierPartAuxiliaryID == the cart line id in LINE_IDS {SPEC}
[FORMAT] UnitPrice/Money matches /^[0-9]+[.][0-9]{2}$/ and Description has an xml:lang attribute {SPEC}

[COUNT] the cXML holds exactly 2 ItemIn elements {SPEC}
[DOM] the ItemIn for P2 is absent from the cXML {SPEC}
[REL] Total/Money == CART_SELECTED_SUBTOTAL {SPEC}

[STATE] DISABLED_WHEN_EMPTY == true, the button is disabled when nothing is selected {SPEC}
[DOM] after the late deselect a toast is visible and it is not a raw translation key {SPEC}
[DATA] GQL_CODE == 'CartIsEmpty', the errorCode of the createPunchoutRequisition GraphQL response of the click {SPEC}
[STATE] LEFT_CHECKOUT == false, nothing was sent to the return URL {SPEC}
[STATE] BUTTON_AFTER == enabled, the buyer can retry after the failure {SPEC}

[REL] each UnitPrice/Money == the placed unit price of the same SKU in LINES {SPEC}
[REL] each UnitPrice/Money != the list price of the same SKU in LINES {SPEC}
[MATH] Total/Money == the sum of (UnitPrice x quantity) over the ItemIn lines, to the cent {SPEC}
[REL] Total/Money == CHK_SUBTOTAL {SPEC}

[REL] TOTAL_PCT == TOTAL_NONE, the cart-level percentage coupon is excluded from Total {SPEC}
[REL] TOTAL_FIXED == TOTAL_NONE, the cart-level fixed coupon is excluded from Total {SPEC}
[REL] TOTAL_PCT == TOTAL_FIXED, both kinds behave the same way {SPEC}
[REL] PRICES_PCT == PRICES_NONE and PRICES_FIXED == PRICES_NONE, cart-level coupons are not allocated into UnitPrice {OBSERVED}
[DOM] a discount row is visible in the cart summary after each coupon was applied {SPEC}

[REL] the UnitOfMeasure of the ItemIn whose SupplierPartID == {{uomSku}} == {{uomUnit}} {SPEC}
[DOM] the UnitOfMeasure of the ItemIn whose SupplierPartID == {{plainSku}} is 'EA' {SPEC}
[DOM] every ItemDetail has a non-empty 'UnitOfMeasure' element {SPEC}
[REL] each UnitPrice/Money == the placed unit price of the same SKU in CHK_PRICES {SPEC}

[REL] every Money/@currency in the cXML == 'EUR' {BL}
[REL] UnitPrice/Money == CHK_PRICE, the placed price read from the cart {SPEC}
[DOM] 'USD' is absent from every Money/@currency while the storefront currency is EUR {BL}
[REL] the cart line for {{plainSku}} is present in the EUR cart, so no CartNotFound toast was shown {SPEC}

[STATE] the return page shows no cXML parse error and no error banner {SPEC}
[REL] each Description text in the cXML == the product name shown at checkout for the same line, characters intact {SPEC}
[COUNT] the cXML holds one ItemIn per cart line {SPEC}

[FORMAT] every UnitPrice/Money and Total/Money in the cXML matches /^[0-9]+[.][0-9]{2}$/ {SPEC}
[DOM] no Money amount contains a ',' character {SPEC}
[REL] the digits of UnitPrice/Money == the digits of CHK_PRICE_DE with the comma read as the decimal separator {SPEC}

[DATA] CODE2 == 'SessionExpired', the errorCode of the createPunchoutRequisition GraphQL response of the click {SPEC}
[STATE] SECOND_POST == false, no second message reaches the return URL {SPEC}
[DOM] a toast is visible after the second click and it is not a raw translation key {SPEC}
[STATE] the button is enabled again after the refused click so the buyer is not stuck {SPEC}

[COUNT] REQ_COUNT_1 == 1 and REQ_COUNT_2 == 1, one createRequisition request per click sequence {SPEC}
[COUNT] ARRIVALS_1 == 1 and ARRIVALS_2 == 1, exactly one requisition reaches the return page per session {SPEC}
[STATE] EARLY_TOAST_1 == false and EARLY_TOAST_2 == false, no error toast is visible before the navigation {SPEC}

[COUNT] ARRIVALS == 1 {SPEC}
[DATA] LOSER_CODE == 'SessionExpired', the errorCode of the createPunchoutRequisition GraphQL response of the click {SPEC}
[DOM] a toast is visible in the losing tab and that tab did not navigate {SPEC}

[DOM] LABEL_PLAIN is 'Place order' and no button labelled 'Create requisition' is shown {SPEC}
[STATE] MODE_PLAIN == false, no 'Punchout mode' label {SPEC}
[DOM] LABEL_PUNCHOUT is 'Create requisition' {SPEC}
[DOM] LABEL_AFTER is 'Place order' and no button labelled 'Create requisition' is shown {SPEC}
[STATE] MODE_AFTER == false after signing out of punchout mode and back in by password {SPEC}

[DER] the ItemIn for P1 has quantity 4 {SPEC}
[DER] the ItemIn for P2 has quantity 1 {SPEC}
[REL] Total/Money == SUBTOTAL_AFTER and != SUBTOTAL_BEFORE {SPEC}

[STATE] OFF_CONFIRMED == true, the setting really was off at the click {SPEC}
[DATA] CODE == 'StoreNotConfigured', the errorCode of the createPunchoutRequisition GraphQL response of the click {SPEC}
[STATE] LEFT == false, nothing was sent to the return URL {SPEC}
[DOM] a toast is visible and it is not a raw translation key {SPEC}
[STATE] ON_CONFIRMED == true, the setting is restored {SPEC}

[REL] CURRENT_ORG == {{orgNow}} {BL}
[REL] the set of SupplierPartID values in the cXML == SCREEN_SKUS {SPEC}
[DOM] the cXML contains the SKU of PA and not the SKU of PB (the other organization's cart is never sent) {BL}
[DOM] the organization switcher is absent from the header in punchout mode {OBSERVED}

[REL] every Money/@currency in the cXML == CHK_CUR {SPEC}
[REL] the set of SupplierPartID values in the cXML == the SKUs in CHK_LINES {SPEC}
[STATE] the browser location is the return page {SPEC}
[DOM] no 'try again' toast was shown on the way {SPEC}

[REL] the ItemIn SupplierPartID == the `sku` of the configurable line in the storefront GraphQL cart (`Configuration-<PCFG code>`, the value createOrderFromCart writes to the order line), not the bare code of PCFG and not the code of a selected option {SPEC}
[REL] UnitPrice/Money == CHK_PRICE, the price including the selected options {SPEC}
[COUNT] the cXML holds one ItemIn for the configurable product {SPEC}

[REL] the ItemIn SupplierPartID == PVAR {SPEC}
[DOM] the parent SKU {{PARENT}} is absent from every SupplierPartID {SPEC}
[REL] the ItemIn SupplierPartID == CHK_SKU {SPEC}

[DOM] TOAST_A is shown and is not a raw translation key (no 'punchout.errors' text) {SPEC}
[DATA] CODE_A == 'CartIsEmpty', the errorCode of the createPunchoutRequisition GraphQL response of the click {SPEC}
[STATE] BUTTON_A == enabled and LOADING_A == false after the failure {SPEC}
[REL] TOAST_DE != TOAST_A, the toast is translated in German {SPEC}
[STATE] the success path ended on the return page {SPEC}

[REL] the origin of POST_URL == the origin of {{retUrl}}, the return URL given at setup {SPEC}
[REL] the origin of FINAL_LOCATION == the origin of {{retUrl}} {SPEC}
[DOM] the host of POST_URL is present in the allow-list of configuration 0 {SPEC}
[COUNT] no request carrying the cXML field went to any other host {SPEC}

[DATA label=pw] data.createPunchoutRequisition.errorCode = SessionNotFound {SPEC}
[NULL label=pw] data.createPunchoutRequisition.cxml is null {SPEC}
[DATA label=anon] data.createPunchoutRequisition.errorCode = SessionNotFound {SPEC}
[NULL label=anon] data.createPunchoutRequisition.cxml is null {SPEC}
[DATA label=otherstore] data.createPunchoutRequisition.errorCode = SessionNotFound {SPEC}
[NULL label=otherstore] data.createPunchoutRequisition.cxml is null {SPEC}
[ERRORS label=otherstore] errors[] is empty or carries no stack trace {BL}

[REL] SENT_SKUS == SCREEN_SKUS, the cart on screen is the cart sent, even though no cart is named default {SPEC}
[DATA] CODE != 'CartNotFound', the errorCode of the createPunchoutRequisition GraphQL response of the click, while SCREEN_SKUS lists PN {SPEC}
[COUNT] SCREEN_SKUS_2 has 0 entries, no line is listed {OBSERVED}
[STATE] with no lines on screen, BUTTON_ENABLED_2 == false or (CODE_2 == 'CartNotFound' and LEFT_2 == false) {SPEC}
